==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**9 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The burrowing [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] may interrupt your rows of meatshields, so it is recommended to have heavy damage to be able to knock them back before they burrow/cause problems in your line of spam. A good no-[[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha]] strategy for this stage is using 3-4 meatshields, [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|dual]] [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]], and possibly [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]]. Build up a large stack of ranged units on the opening [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]], then take out Gravey with said ranged firepower. When Gravey respawns, he will be much weaker and easier to deal with due to the amount of his support you should have already taken out.

==Trivia==
*Silenced Meowing's Japanese name, Neko-tachi no Chinmoku (猫たちの沈黙, "Silence of the Cats"), is a reference to the psychological horror novel ''[[wikipedia:The Silence of the Lambs (novel)|The Silence of the Lambs]]'', or more likely the 1991 film adaptation.
*Prior to [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]]:
**[[Shadow Boxer K]] started spawning after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup> instead of 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**The delay between Shadow Boxer Ks was 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup> instead of 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**[[Gory Dark]] started spawning after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup> instead of 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**The boss fight had an extra 3 [[Zory|Zories]] that spawned 33.3~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup> apart, separate from the main 9 Zories.

